  "tooltip.flavor_immersed_daily_spoofchicken.mango_white_cut_chicken.short": "鸡不可失，芒里偷甜。",
  "tooltip.flavor_immersed_daily_spoofchicken.mango_white_cut_chicken.detail": "甜品区借来的酱，最后报销在荤菜区。",
  "tooltip.flavor_immersed_daily_spoofchicken.pineapple_white_cut_chicken.short": "菠萝找到了新搭子。",
  "tooltip.flavor_immersed_daily_spoofchicken.pineapple_white_cut_chicken.detail": "不是菠萝咕咾肉，是白切鸡主动转岗。",
  "tooltip.flavor_immersed_daily_spoofchicken.durian_white_cut_chicken.short": "闻着很有主见。",
  "tooltip.flavor_immersed_daily_spoofchicken.durian_white_cut_chicken.detail": "鸡没说话，整张餐桌已经开始讨论了。",
  "tooltip.flavor_immersed_daily_spoofchicken.peanut_white_cut_chicken.short": "花生什么事了？",
  "tooltip.flavor_immersed_daily_spoofchicken.peanut_white_cut_chicken.detail": "本来是下酒小菜，现在承包了整只鸡。",
  "tooltip.flavor_immersed_daily_spoofchicken.salad_white_cut_chicken.short": "轻食的包装，整鸡的分量。",
  "tooltip.flavor_immersed_daily_spoofchicken.salad_white_cut_chicken.detail": "只要叫沙拉，鸡就能假装自己是蔬菜。",
  "tooltip.flavor_immersed_daily_spoofchicken.mayonnaise_white_cut_chicken.short": "蛋与鸡，终于同盘。",
  "tooltip.flavor_immersed_daily_spoofchicken.mayonnaise_white_cut_chicken.detail": "先有鸡还是先有蛋？先别问，先拌匀。",
  "tooltip.flavor_immersed_daily_spoofchicken.ketchup_white_cut_chicken.short": "薯条的酱，鸡先蘸了。",
  "tooltip.flavor_immersed_daily_spoofchicken.ketchup_white_cut_chicken.detail": "盘里没有薯条，但有一只很懂搭配的鸡。",
  "tooltip.flavor_immersed_daily_spoofchicken.chili_white_cut_chicken.short": "白切鸡，红着脸上桌。",
  "tooltip.flavor_immersed_daily_spoofchicken.chili_white_cut_chicken.detail": "厨师说微辣，辣椒说我没同意。",
  "tooltip.flavor_immersed_daily_spoofchicken.honey_white_cut_chicken.short": "甜言蜜语，鸡全信了。",
  "tooltip.flavor_immersed_daily_spoofchicken.honey_white_cut_chicken.detail": "蜂蜜负责甜，鸡负责把它当正餐。",
  "tooltip.flavor_immersed_daily_spoofchicken.matcha_white_cut_chicken.short": "绿得像刚办了健身卡。",
  "tooltip.flavor_immersed_daily_spoofchicken.matcha_white_cut_chicken.detail": "抹茶一盖，连鸡都开始讲究下午茶了。",
  "tooltip.flavor_immersed_daily_spoofchicken.taro_white_cut_chicken.short": "芋泥啵啵，鸡也要抱抱。",
  "tooltip.flavor_immersed_daily_spoofchicken.taro_white_cut_chicken.detail": "土豆换了身紫衣服，鸡选择不拆穿。",
  "tooltip.flavor_immersed_daily_spoofchicken.yogurt_white_cut_chicken.short": "酸奶碗里的荤菜嘉宾。",
  "tooltip.flavor_immersed_daily_spoofchicken.yogurt_white_cut_chicken.detail": "早饭吃得很健康，直到发现碗里有鸡。",
  "tooltip.flavor_immersed_daily_spoofchicken.peach_oolong_white_cut_chicken.short": "桃气十足，鸡情四溢。",
  "tooltip.flavor_immersed_daily_spoofchicken.peach_oolong_white_cut_chicken.detail": "奶茶加料的尽头，是加一整盘白切鸡。",
  "tooltip.flavor_immersed_daily_spoofchicken.sea_salt_cheese_white_cut_chicken.short": "奶盖够厚，鸡就不尴尬。",
  "tooltip.flavor_immersed_daily_spoofchicken.sea_salt_cheese_white_cut_chicken.detail": "海盐提味，芝士提胆量，厨师提桶下班。",
  "tooltip.flavor_immersed_daily_spoofchicken.fish_mint_tea_white_cut_chicken.short": "奶茶圈与凉拌菜圈的联名。",
  "tooltip.flavor_immersed_daily_spoofchicken.fish_mint_tea_white_cut_chicken.detail": "有人说清新，有人问这鸡刚从哪条沟回来。",
  "tooltip.flavor_immersed_daily_spoofchicken.bubble_tea_white_cut_chicken.short": "加珍珠，还是加鸡？都要。",
  "tooltip.flavor_immersed_daily_spoofchicken.bubble_tea_white_cut_chicken.detail": "正常加料五块，这次加料会打鸣。",
  "tooltip.flavor_immersed_daily_spoofchicken.mango_pomelo_white_cut_chicken.short": "甜品菜单上混进了一盘鸡。",
  "tooltip.flavor_immersed_daily_spoofchicken.mango_pomelo_white_cut_chicken.detail": "芒果、椰汁、珍珠都到了，就鸡不是来喝的。",
  "tooltip.flavor_immersed_daily_spoofchicken.cola_white_cut_chicken.short": "可乐鸡翅的远房大哥。",
  "tooltip.flavor_immersed_daily_spoofchicken.cola_white_cut_chicken.detail": "鸡翅能配可乐，整只鸡觉得自己也行。",
  "tooltip.flavor_immersed_daily_spoofchicken.sprite_white_cut_chicken.short": "透心凉，鸡心飞扬。",
  "tooltip.flavor_immersed_daily_spoofchicken.sprite_white_cut_chicken.detail": "气泡负责热闹，白切鸡负责显得很无辜。",
  "tooltip.flavor_immersed_daily_spoofchicken.orange_white_cut_chicken.short": "橙意满满，鸡不可待。",
  "tooltip.flavor_immersed_daily_spoofchicken.orange_white_cut_chicken.detail": "早餐橙汁浇错了盘，厨师顺势起了个名。",
  "tooltip.flavor_immersed_daily_spoofchicken.pineapple_beer_white_cut_chicken.short": "一盘有果香的下酒鸡。",
  "tooltip.flavor_immersed_daily_spoofchicken.pineapple_beer_white_cut_chicken.detail": "菠萝负责清爽，啤酒负责让配方听着合理。",
  "tooltip.flavor_immersed_daily_spoofchicken.lemon_tea_white_cut_chicken.short": "柠檬手打，白鸡白切。",
  "tooltip.flavor_immersed_daily_spoofchicken.lemon_tea_white_cut_chicken.detail": "本来想点少冰，结果点成了少一口鸡。",
  "tooltip.flavor_immersed_daily_spoofchicken.plum_white_cut_chicken.short": "酸梅汤从杯里搬进了盘里。",
  "tooltip.flavor_immersed_daily_spoofchicken.plum_white_cut_chicken.detail": "解腻的和油腻的，这次直接住一起了。",
  "tooltip.flavor_immersed_daily_spoofchicken.herbal_tea_white_cut_chicken.short": "怕上火？鸡已经凉了。",
  "tooltip.flavor_immersed_daily_spoofchicken.herbal_tea_white_cut_chicken.detail": "红罐一开，白切鸡也想承包夏天的饭桌。",
  "tooltip.flavor_immersed_daily_spoofchicken.wangzai_milk_white_cut_chicken.short": "再看我，就把你拌成鸡。",
  "tooltip.flavor_immersed_daily_spoofchicken.wangzai_milk_white_cut_chicken.detail": "童年的奶香长大了，开始参加正餐。",
  "tooltip.flavor_immersed_daily_spoofchicken.stinky_tofu_white_cut_chicken.short": "香不香，先别急着下结论。",
  "tooltip.flavor_immersed_daily_spoofchicken.stinky_tofu_white_cut_chicken.detail": "鸡很安静，但它的邻居存在感特别强。",
  "tooltip.flavor_immersed_daily_spoofchicken.huoxiang_white_cut_chicken.short": "这味道，鸡也得缓一缓。",
  "tooltip.flavor_immersed_daily_spoofchicken.huoxiang_white_cut_chicken.detail": "瓶子很像药，配方很像闹；这里只管饱。",
  "tooltip.flavor_immersed_daily_spoofchicken.chocolate_white_cut_chicken.short": "甜点师和厨师同时沉默了。",
  "tooltip.flavor_immersed_daily_spoofchicken.chocolate_white_cut_chicken.detail": "巧克力没做错什么，鸡也是。",
  "tooltip.flavor_immersed_daily_spoofchicken.popping_candy_white_cut_chicken.short": "鸡已白切，糖还在蹦迪。",
  "tooltip.flavor_immersed_daily_spoofchicken.popping_candy_white_cut_chicken.detail": "嘴里开派对，盘里的鸡负责镇场。",
  "tooltip.flavor_immersed_daily_spoofchicken.fermented_tofu_white_cut_chicken.short": "小小一块，拿捏整盘。",
  "tooltip.flavor_immersed_daily_spoofchicken.fermented_tofu_white_cut_chicken.detail": "豆腐修炼成了腐乳，鸡负责见证它的实力。",
  "tooltip.flavor_immersed_daily_spoofchicken.taro_paste.short": "有没有芋头，颜色说了算。",
  "tooltip.flavor_immersed_daily_spoofchicken.taro_paste.detail": "土豆加紫色染料：外观先毕业，专业再慢慢补。",
  "tooltip.flavor_immersed_daily_spoofchicken.fish_mint_milk_tea.short": "奶茶里有草，也有鱼的意见。",
  "tooltip.flavor_immersed_daily_spoofchicken.fish_mint_milk_tea.detail": "蕨负责折耳根的形，鳕鱼负责折耳根的魂。",
  "tooltip.flavor_immersed_daily_spoofchicken.wang_lao_ji.short": "茶加花加糖，红罐自己想象。",
  "tooltip.flavor_immersed_daily_spoofchicken.wang_lao_ji.detail": "蒲公英友情出演草本，本罐主打一本正经地瞎配。",
  "tooltip.flavor_immersed_daily_spoofchicken.huoxiang_zhengqi_water.short": "姜、蘑菇和酒，谁也没想到。",
  "tooltip.flavor_immersed_daily_spoofchicken.huoxiang_zhengqi_water.detail": "看着像药，喝着像勇气；游戏里只当普通饮料。",
  "tooltip.flavor_immersed_daily_spoofchicken.popping_candy.short": "糖负责甜，红石负责有动静。",
  "tooltip.flavor_immersed_daily_spoofchicken.popping_candy.detail": "加点小苏打，给舌头安排一场像素蹦迪。"
}
